{"id":"b2f00e46d071f3ce","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-derivable.md","title":"Sequent derivability (legacy parameterized calculus)","display":"df-derivable — Sequent derivability (legacy parameterized calculus)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-derivable","aliases":["27-df-derivable"],"display":"df-derivable — Sequent derivability (legacy parameterized calculus)","depends_on":["[[27-df-sequent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-derivable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-derivable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivable — Sequent derivability (legacy parameterized calculus)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0340b31d187863dd\" href=\"?note=0340b31d187863dd\" title=\"27-df-sequent\">27-df-sequent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sequent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sequent}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0340b31d187863dd\" href=\"?note=0340b31d187863dd\" title=\"27-df-sequent\">27-df-sequent</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\)</span> 为给定演算数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sequent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sequent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sequent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sequent}_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sequent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sequent}_S)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,q\\in\\mathrm{Sequent}_S\">\\(s,q\\in\\mathrm{Sequent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}X^k\">\\(X^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}X^k\\)</span>。带标签树节点为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d)\">\\(\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d)\\)</span>，标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"11\">\\(11\\)</span> 与公式标签不同。</li>\n<li>引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{root},\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{root},\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}s\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}s\\)</span>。规则是“有限前提列、结论”的关系，不假定为全函数或某个特定完备演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d)\\coloneqq\\langle11,q,\\vec d\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{root}(\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d))\\coloneqq q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d)\\coloneqq\\langle11,q,\\vec d\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{root}(\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d))\\coloneqq q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},0}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{node}(q,\\langle\\rangle)\\mid q\\in\\mathrm{Ax}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},0}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{node}(q,\\langle\\rangle)\\mid q\\in\\mathrm{Ax}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n}\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{node}(q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle)\\ \\middle|\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ q\\in\\mathrm{Sequent}_S,\\ (d_1,\\ldots,d_k)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n}^k,\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\left(\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{root}(d_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{root}(d_k)\\rangle,q\\rangle\\in R\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n}\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{node}(q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle)\\ \\middle|\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ q\\in\\mathrm{Sequent}_S,\\ (d_1,\\ldots,d_k)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n}^k,\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\left(\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{root}(d_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{root}(d_k)\\rangle,q\\rangle\\in R\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n},\\qquad\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}s\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\;(\\mathrm{root}(d)=s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n},\\qquad\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}s\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\;(\\mathrm{root}(d)=s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>已读取原外部 57-df-fin-deriv-tree：其 FinDerivTree 实为可证根矢列集合，真正树集合名为 DerTrees；旧 27 把前者当作树域，发生实际类型漂移。现在本地直接定义 27 原本需要的树域，不再冒用该不兼容名称的来源。</li>\n<li>包含零前提规则和零子树列；有限深度阶段闭包确保每个被量化对象确为有限规则正确树。不声称 SC 的可靠性、完备性或有效性，也未替用户选一个具体演算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"0340b31d187863dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"0340b31d187863dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sequent}_S$ 见 [[27-df-sequent]]；$\\mathrm{SC}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle$ 为给定演算数据，$\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sequent}_S$，$\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sequent}_S^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sequent}_S)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sequent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SC}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sequent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sequent}_S^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sequent}_S)","display":false},{"tex":"s,q\\in\\mathrm{Sequent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}X^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d)","display":false},{"tex":"11","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{root},\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d)\\coloneqq\\langle11,q,\\vec d\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{root}(\\mathrm{node}(q,\\vec d))\\coloneqq q.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},0}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{node}(q,\\langle\\rangle)\\mid q\\in\\mathrm{Ax}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n}\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{node}(q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle)\\ \\middle|\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ q\\in\\mathrm{Sequent}_S,\\ (d_1,\\ldots,d_k)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n}^k,\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\left(\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{root}(d_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{root}(d_k)\\rangle,q\\rangle\\in R\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{SC},n},\\qquad\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}s\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\;(\\mathrm{root}(d)=s).","display":true}],"bytes":2621,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-derivable|df-derivable — Sequent derivability (legacy parameterized calculus)]]"}],"outgoing":["0340b31d187863dd"]}